    docs(board): DB-GAP-059 — integration suite leaks orphaned scratch daemons
    
    Host audit found two orphaned test-spawned DuckBrain daemons live at once
    (:33523 2h13m, :30720 1h34m) — 3.7/3.9GB RSS, 41% CPU each, ~10k FDs each,
    20k scratch files in /tmp. SIGTERM did not kill either.
    
    Row records the three compounding defects (detached spawn with no process-level
    reaper; an un-timed test probe; GET /users walking the real 227-namespace root
    with 1h connection recycling) plus the fix shape and the armed host-side guard.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
